{%- comment -%}
Minimal homepage for the option B demo theme. The demo covers two templates
(Curated Collection product page, subscription-builder quiz); the rest of the
site is not ported yet, so the homepage is a plain index of what exists.
Also satisfies Shopify's requirement that a publishable theme has an index
template.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% render 'hyun-nav' %}
<section style="min-height:60vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;">
  <div style="text-align:center;padding:60px 24px;">
    <div class="title-upper-text" style="margin-bottom:16px;">Option B demo</div>
    <h1 class="heading-12" style="margin-bottom:40px;">Two templates, zero Webflow</h1>
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;align-items:center;">
      <a href="/products/curated-collection" class="primary-button w-button">Curated Collection (product page)</a>
      <a href="/pages/subscription-builder" class="primary-button tertiarybtn w-button">Subscription Builder (quiz)</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% render 'hyun-footer' %}
